      "message": "When vmx-\u003efail is set, the kvm will return to the user space with exit reason KVM_EXIT_FAIL_ENTRY. Normally the user space will stop entering the guest again. But that is totally depending on the user space. The user space can still enter the guest in this case. So I think you are right, we can reset vmx-\u003efail before enter the guest again.",
